        "sign_9NpxTM": {
          "type": "sign",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Dr. Sebi Saw What Modern Food Was Doing Before Most People Felt It",
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/sebi-knees-1x1.gif",
            "image_alt": "",
            "body": "<p>Dr. Sebi's entire philosophy started with a simple warning: the body cannot defend or rebuild itself without the natural compounds it was designed to receive.</p><p>Then we industrialized the food supply. We processed it, sprayed it, stripped it, stored it, and filled the empty space with ingredients your grandparents never ate. The plate still looked full. The cells underneath it were running on fumes.</p>",
            "close_text": "You cannot drug a starving cell back to health. You have to give it the protection modern life removed.",
            "show_inline_cta": false,
            "inline_cta_text": "",
            "inline_cta_label": "See the one thing built to get in",
            "testimonial_1_initial": "",
