        "sign_km8QJC": {
          "type": "sign",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "After 40, Your Antioxidant Shield Starts Coming Down",
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/free-radicals.gif",
            "image_alt": "",
            "body": "<p>You did not get lazy. You did not \"let yourself go.\" When you were young, your body cleared oxidative waste almost as fast as you made it. After 40, that cleanup crew starts shrinking. Every birthday, fewer defenders are left to handle more damage.</p><p>Oxygen itself creates free radicals as your cells turn food into energy. The thing keeping you alive is also creating the spark. You cannot stop breathing. You cannot stop having birthdays.</p>",
            "close_text": "The stiff hands, the knee on the stairs, the shoulder at 3 a.m. You did not suddenly fall apart. Your shield came down.",
            "show_inline_cta": false,
            "inline_cta_text": "",
            "inline_cta_label": "See the one thing built to get in",
            "testimonial_1_initial": "",
            "testimonial_1_text": "",
