            "image": "shopify://shop_images/1-ingredient.jpg",
            "image_alt": "",
            "body": "<p>Most joint bottles hide behind complexity. Fifteen ingredients. Twenty ingredients. A label that looks powerful until you notice every ingredient is barely there.</p><p>REVELLA goes the opposite direction. One ingredient: natural astaxanthin from microalgae. A full <strong>12mg in every softgel.</strong> Most competing formulas stop at 4 to 6mg, just enough to print the name on the label and hope you never check.</p>",
