        "sign_FTwAem": {
          "type": "sign",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "The First Change Is That You Stop Negotiating With Your Own Body",
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/doctor-noticed.jpg",
            "image_alt": "",
            "body": "<p>This is not a six-hour painkiller. The rot took years to build, so give your cells a full 30 days to start turning the fight around.</p><p>First, the morning move stops feeling like a negotiation. Then you reach for the top shelf without planning around the catch. You take the deck steps without doing the math. You get out of the car without the grunt.</p><p>Then a grandchild asks you to get on the floor and you just do it. No risk calculation. No looking for something sturdy to pull yourself back up.</p><p>In a customer survey, <strong>94% of REVELLA customers reported meaningful improvement within their first 30 days.</strong></p>",
            "close_text": "Day one may feel like nothing. Feeling nothing is not the same as nothing happening. Day one is the day you stop leaving your cells unguarded.",
            "show_inline_cta": false,
            "inline_cta_text": "",
            "inline_cta_label": "See the one thing built to get in",
